Start the members of the channel "{{.Title}}" (bridge {{.ID}}) for {{.Operator}}.

The goal of the channel: {{.Goal}}

Call spawn_task once for each member below, with wait false, one call per member. Give each call:
- agent: the profile of the member.
- input: the first line "[seat <handle>]" and then the input of the member, as the member below shows it. The front finds the member of a child by that line.
- instructions: the instructions of the member between <<< and >>>, word for word, without the two marks.
- max_turns and deadline: the budget of the member, when the member has one.

Do not do the work of a member yourself. When every call returned, end your turn with the list of the agents that you started: the handle and the task of each, in plain words for the person, with no ids of runs.
